240px_1fr] gap-[22px]\"><div class=\"bg-cuca-dark text-white rounded-3xl p-[22px]\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-3\">CUCA Admin</h2><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 bg-gradient-btn text-cuca-dark font-black\">数据总览</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">代理管理</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">会员管理</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">租赁托管</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">三级分销</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">门店加盟</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">AI员工</div><div class=\"px-[11px] py-[11px] rounded-xl my-1.5 text-[#cbd5e1]\">专属网站</div></div><div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5\"><span>今日线索</span><br><b class=\"text-[28px]\">286</b></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5\"><span>托管订单</span><br><b class=\"text-[28px]\">48</b></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5\"><span>待分红</span><br><b class=\"text-[28px]\">$36,820</b></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-[18px] overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 py-3 font-black text-[#334155] border-b border-gray-200 min-w-[640px]\"><span>代理</span><span>级别</span><span>来源</span><span>状态</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 py-3 border-b border-gray-200 min-w-[640px]\"><span>Steven SG</span><span>城市代理</span><span>TikTok</span><span>跟进中</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 py-3 border-b border-gray-200 min-w-[640px]\"><span>Johor Team</span><span>区域代理</span><span>专属网站</span><span>已成交</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 py-3 border-b border-gray-200 min-w-[640px]\"><span>Malaysia Partner</span><span>国家代理</span><span>AI客服</span><span>洽谈中</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-col